{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（28日）上午9時許，一名年約50多歲女子疑從高處墮下，倒臥尖沙嘴金巴利道美麗華廣場1期對開，女事主昏迷由救護員送往伊利沙伯醫院，警方圍封一段路面調查，初步相信女事主在商場平台墮下，倒臥通往諾士佛臺的樓梯位置，正調查其身分墮樓原因。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:21:20.012210+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T03:46:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T05:18:17.028714+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T04:18:17.441953+00:00","content_hash":"37c037c27e8e973e9e3b7949e4491b8fcb2f9107a29968b535f81491bec04c11","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}